#. installer page (step)
msgid "Entorno de escritorio"
msgstr "Desktop environment"

#. installer page (name)
msgid "XFCE (temático)"
msgstr "XFCE (themed)"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "El entorno validado en hardware real (Packard Bell iMedia S2883). Xorg, ligero, recomendado desde 1 GB de RAM o cuando la GPU no soporta Wayland."
msgstr "The environment validated on real hardware (Packard Bell iMedia S2883). Xorg, lightweight, recommended from 1 GB of RAM or when the GPU can't do Wayland."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Openbox minimal"
msgstr "Openbox minimal"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "El nivel más bajo: 512 MB. Openbox + tint2 + jgmenu, sin compositor por defecto."
msgstr "The lowest tier: 512 MB. Openbox + tint2 + jgmenu, no compositor by default."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Hyprland + Astal (lite)"
msgstr "Hyprland + Astal (lite)"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Wayland, 2-4 GB. Mismo shell Astal que la versión full, sin blur/sombras/animaciones pesadas."
msgstr "Wayland, 2-4 GB. Same Astal shell as the full version, without blur, shadows or heavy animations."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Hyprland + Astal (full)"
msgstr "Hyprland + Astal (full)"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Wayland, techo recomendado de 4 GB. Blur, sombras y animaciones completas. Necesita una GPU con buen soporte de Wayland."
msgstr "Wayland, recommended ceiling of 4 GB. Blur, shadows and full animations. Needs a GPU with good Wayland support."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "KDE Plasma"
msgstr "KDE Plasma"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "El escritorio completo y familiar: barra abajo, menú de inicio, Dolphin y ajustes para todo. Wayland, desde 4 GB de RAM. Es el entorno más pesado; sl-detect no lo recomienda por defecto."
msgstr "The complete, familiar desktop: bar at the bottom, start menu, Dolphin and settings for everything. Wayland, from 4 GB of RAM. The heaviest environment; sl-detect doesn't recommend it by default."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "GNOME"
msgstr "GNOME"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "El escritorio de GNOME tal cual: vista de actividades, dock y apps GNOME. Wayland, desde 4 GB de RAM. El tema llega al modo claro u oscuro, al acento, al fondo y a las apps. Entra con GDM."
msgstr "The GNOME desktop as it is: activities overview, dock and GNOME apps. Wayland, from 4 GB of RAM. The theme reaches light or dark mode, the accent, the wallpaper and the apps. Signs in with GDM."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Cinnamon"
msgstr "Cinnamon"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Clásico y cómodo: barra abajo, menú de inicio e iconos en el escritorio. Xorg, desde 2 GB. El tema también viste el panel y el menú."
msgstr "Classic and comfortable: bar at the bottom, start menu and desktop icons. Xorg, from 2 GB. The theme also dresses the panel and the menu."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "i3"
msgstr "i3"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Mosaico con el teclado: las ventanas se colocan solas. Xorg, desde 1 GB. Barra i3bar, lanzador rofi. Super + Intro abre la terminal."
msgstr "Tiling from the keyboard: windows arrange themselves. Xorg, from 1 GB. i3bar, rofi launcher. Super + Enter opens the terminal."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "bspwm"
msgstr "bspwm"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Mosaico por árbol binario, atajos en sxhkd y barra polybar. Xorg, desde 1 GB. Para quien quiere configurarlo todo."
msgstr "Binary-tree tiling, shortcuts in sxhkd and a polybar bar. Xorg, from 1 GB. For those who want to configure everything."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "sway"
msgstr "sway"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "El mosaico de i3, en Wayland. Desde 1-2 GB. Barra waybar, lanzador rofi y avisos con mako."
msgstr "i3's tiling, on Wayland. From 1-2 GB. waybar bar, rofi launcher and notifications with mako."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Sin entorno gráfico"
msgstr "No graphical environment"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Solo la consola: arranca a la línea de comandos, sin servidor gráfico, sin navegador y sin audio. Con tmux, btop y sl-ctl. Desde 512 MB."
msgstr "Just the console: boots to the command line, with no display server, no browser and no audio. With tmux, btop and sl-ctl. From 512 MB."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Servidor / Homelab"
msgstr "Server / Homelab"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Sin entorno gráfico y con el sabor Servidor: Docker, Nginx, MariaDB, WireGuard, Fail2ban y Cockpit (panel web). Nada escucha en la red hasta que lo actives con «sl-ctl server»."
msgstr "No graphical environment, with the Server flavor: Docker, Nginx, MariaDB, WireGuard, Fail2ban and Cockpit (web panel). Nothing listens on the network until you enable it with «sl-ctl server»."

#. installer page (step)
msgid "Sabores"
msgstr "Flavors"

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Sabores (opcional)"
msgstr "Flavors (optional)"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Paquetes de apps listos para lo que vayas a hacer. Marca los que quieras (puedes elegir varios o ninguno): se instalan con el sistema y cada uno viene ajustado para rendir bien. Todo se puede añadir o quitar después desde la bienvenida."
msgstr "App bundles ready for whatever you're going to do. Tick the ones you want (several or none): they're installed with the system and each one comes tuned to perform well. Everything can be added or removed later from the welcome app."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Gaming"
msgstr "Gaming"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Steam con Proton, Lutris, Heroic (Epic, GOG, Amazon), Prism Launcher y Modrinth para Minecraft, MangoHud, GameMode y Gamescope. Activa las librerías de 32 bits y el driver Vulkan de tu GPU."
msgstr "Steam with Proton, Lutris, Heroic (Epic, GOG, Amazon), Prism Launcher and Modrinth for Minecraft, MangoHud, GameMode and Gamescope. Enables 32-bit libraries and your GPU's Vulkan driver."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Creación de contenido"
msgstr "Content creation"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Krita, GIMP, Inkscape, Blender, Kdenlive, Shotcut, OBS, Audacity y los DAWs Ardour, LMMS e Hydrogen, con audio en tiempo real (baja latencia)."
msgstr "Krita, GIMP, Inkscape, Blender, Kdenlive, Shotcut, OBS, Audacity and the Ardour, LMMS and Hydrogen DAWs, with real-time (low-latency) audio."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Git y GitHub CLI, Docker (se arranca solo al usarlo), VS Code (Code - OSS), Python, Rust, Node y Java."
msgstr "Git and GitHub CLI, Docker (starts on its own when used), VS Code (Code - OSS), Python, Rust, Node and Java."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Oficina"
msgstr "Office"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "LibreOffice en español con corrector, Obsidian, KeePassXC, Xournal++ y herramientas de PDF."
msgstr "LibreOffice with spell checking, Obsidian, KeePassXC, Xournal++ and PDF tools."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "KVM/QEMU con virt-manager y GNOME Boxes, con TPM y UEFI para invitados Windows 11."
msgstr "KVM/QEMU with virt-manager and GNOME Boxes, with TPM and UEFI for Windows 11 guests."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Educación"
msgstr "Education"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "GeoGebra, Stellarium, Anki, Jupyter y FreeCAD."
msgstr "GeoGebra, Stellarium, Anki, Jupyter and FreeCAD."

#. installer page (name)
msgid "Ciberseguridad"
msgstr "Cybersecurity"

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Nmap, Wireshark, Hashcat, John, Metasploit, Ghidra y Tor."
msgstr "Nmap, Wireshark, Hashcat, John, Metasploit, Ghidra and Tor."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Docker, Nginx, MariaDB, WireGuard, Fail2ban y Cockpit. Por seguridad ningún servicio se queda escuchando hasta que tú lo actives."
msgstr "Docker, Nginx, MariaDB, WireGuard, Fail2ban and Cockpit. For safety, no service listens until you enable it."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "El tema de Static Linux. Oscuro y cálido: madera, mostaza y verde azulado, sobre «Tormenta bajo el Fuji» de Hokusai. Barra fina arriba y ventanas sólidas."
msgstr "The Static Linux theme. Dark and warm: wood, mustard and teal, over Hokusai's «Storm below Mount Fuji». Thin bar at the top and solid windows."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Claro, en tonos de papel envejecido, tinta y verde oliva, sobre un grabado de Hokusai. Para quien trabaja con mucha luz."
msgstr "Light, in tones of aged paper, ink and olive green, over a Hokusai print. For people who work in bright light."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Oscuro y frío: pizarra azulada y hielo, sobre «Nieve al anochecer en Kanbara» de Hiroshige."
msgstr "Dark and cold: bluish slate and ice, over Hiroshige's «Night Snow at Kambara»."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Oscuro, en verdes de pino y niebla, sobre «Lluvia de primavera en Tsuchiyama» de Hiroshige."
msgstr "Dark, in pine and mist greens, over Hiroshige's «Spring Rain at Tsuchiyama»."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Oscuro con rosa cerezo, sobre «El Fuji desde Gotenyama» de Hokusai."
msgstr "Dark with cherry pink, over Hokusai's «Fuji from Gotenyama»."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Oscuro y monocromo en violeta, con montañas al anochecer."
msgstr "Dark, monochrome violet, with mountains at dusk."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Estilo Frutiger Aero: claro, con cielo, burbujas y hierba, barras con brillo y la barra de tareas abajo."
msgstr "Frutiger Aero style: light, with sky, bubbles and grass, glossy bars and the taskbar at the bottom."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Parecido a Windows: oscuro, barra de tareas abajo con las apps al centro y botones de ventana ─ □ ✕."
msgstr "Windows-like: dark, taskbar at the bottom with centred apps and ─ □ ✕ window buttons."

#. installer page (description)
msgid "Claro y suave, sobre un cielo con nubes. Lanzador redondo y estante abajo con las apps al centro; la hora abre los ajustes rápidos."
msgstr "Light and soft, over a cloudy sky. Round launcher and a shelf at the bottom with centred apps; the clock opens quick settings."

